# Entity

## Notice

### FEATURES

extends = ["SimpleEntity"]

### ATTRIBUTE

| name          | type   | multiplicity | web-label | web-control-type | web-placeholder | web-help                         | min-length | max-length | pattern              |
|---------------+--------+--------------+-----------+------------------+-----------------+----------------------------------+------------+------------+----------------------|
| senderName    | string | 1            | Sender    |                  | Your name       | Name displayed as the poster.    | 1              |                |                      |
| recipientName | string | 1            | Recipient |                  | Recipient name  | Name used by recipients to find notices. | 1              |                |                      |
| title         | string | 1            | Title     |                  | Short title     | Short title shown in lists.      | 1              | 80             | pass:[^[A-Za-z0-9 ]+$] |
| summary       | string | 0..1     | Summary   | textarea         | Summary         | Localized summary text.          | 2              | 160            |                      |
| content       | string | 1            | Content   | textarea         | Notice content  | Main notice text.                | 1              |                |                      |
